<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Affiche TDBR — découverte</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4 portrait;
            margin: 0;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #2C2416;
            background: #fff;
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        }

        .page {
            width: 210mm;
            height: 297mm;
            position: relative;
            background: #FAF6EE;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .ribbon-top {
            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 12mm; background: #2C2416;
        }
        .ribbon-bottom {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 14mm; background: #8B7355;
        }

        .corner-deco {
            position: absolute;
            width: 60mm; height: 60mm;
            border-radius: 50%;
            opacity: 0.18;
        }
        .corner-deco.tr { top: -30mm; right: -30mm; background: #D4AF7A; }
        .corner-deco.bl { bottom: 14mm; left: -25mm; background: #D4AF7A; }

        /* En-tête */
        .header {
            position: absolute;
            top: 18mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header img {
            max-height: 28mm;
            width: auto;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .header .brand-fallback {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 36pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            color: #2C2416;
        }
        .header .tagline {
            margin-top: 3mm;
            font-size: 9.5pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.4em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Bloc présentation — image à gauche, texte à droite */
        .intro {
            position: absolute;
            top: 65mm;
            left: 18mm;
            right: 18mm;
        }
        .intro-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: separate;
            border-spacing: 0;
        }
        .intro-table td {
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .intro-img-cell {
            width: 65mm;
            padding-right: 7mm;
        }
        .intro-img-cell img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            border: 2pt solid #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1pt #D4AF7A;
        }
        .intro-text-cell {
            font-size: 11pt;
            line-height: 1.55;
            color: #3D352A;
        }
        .intro-text-cell .salut {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #2C2416;
            margin-bottom: 3mm;
            display: block;
        }
        .intro-text-cell .signature {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 4mm;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Liste des thèmes */
        .themes {
            position: absolute;
            top: 148mm; left: 20mm; right: 20mm;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .themes-title {
            font-size: 11pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.4em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 4mm;
        }
        .themes-list {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 22pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #2C2416;
            line-height: 1.25;
        }
        .themes-list .sep {
            color: #D4AF7A;
            font-weight: 400;
            margin: 0 4mm;
        }
        .themes-sub {
            margin-top: 3mm;
            font-size: 10pt;
            color: #5C4F3C;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Filet décoratif */
        .divider {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            margin-left: -25mm;
            width: 50mm;
            height: 1pt;
            background: #D4AF7A;
        }

        /* Bloc QR */
        .qr-zone {
            position: absolute;
            top: 192mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .qr-card {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5mm;
            background: #fff;
            border: 2pt solid #2C2416;
        }
        .qr-card img {
            display: block;
            width: 45mm; height: 45mm;
        }
        .url {
            margin-top: 5mm;
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 22pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #2C2416;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .url-prefix {
            font-size: 10pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #8B7355;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 1.5mm;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 4mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #FAF6EE;
            font-size: 9pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .footer strong { font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
    <div class="ribbon-top"></div>
    <div class="corner-deco tr"></div>
    <div class="corner-deco bl"></div>
    <div class="ribbon-bottom"></div>

    {# Logo + tagline #}
    <div class="header">
        {% if logoBase64 %}
            <img src="{{ logoBase64 }}" alt="TDBR">
        {% else %}
            <div class="brand-fallback">TDBR</div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="tagline">Humour, fromage et jeux de société</div>
    </div>

    {# Présentation #}
    <div class="intro">
        <table class="intro-table">
            <tr>
                <td class="intro-img-cell">
                    {% if heroBase64 %}
                        <img src="{{ heroBase64 }}" alt="Manu, créateur TDBR">
                    {% endif %}
                </td>
                <td class="intro-text-cell">
                    <span class="salut">TDBR, qui es-tu&nbsp;?</span>
                    Je m'appelle Manu et je suis le créateur de <strong>TDBR</strong>.
                    Je décline mes obsessions sur t-shirts, mugs et goodies&nbsp;:
                    le <strong>fromage</strong> (toujours), les <strong>jeux de société</strong>,
                    et plus largement les <strong>fanarts</strong> qui me font sourire.
                    L'<strong>intelligence artificielle</strong> est mon partenaire de
                    création — pour explorer plus de pistes et tester plus d'idées,
                    sans jamais perdre la patte de chaque visuel.
                    <span class="signature">— Manu</span>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    {# Filet entre intro et thèmes #}
    <div class="divider" style="top: 142mm;"></div>

    {# Thèmes phares #}
    <div class="themes">
        <div class="themes-title">L'univers TDBR</div>
        <div class="themes-list">
            Fromage <span class="sep">·</span>
            Jeux de société <span class="sep">·</span>
            Fanarts
        </div>
        <div class="themes-sub">… et bien d'autres surprises sur le site</div>
    </div>

    {# QR + URL #}
    <div class="qr-zone">
        <div class="qr-card">
            <img src="{{ qrDataUri }}" alt="QR code vers tedybear.fr">
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:4mm;">
            <span class="url-prefix">Scannez ou tapez</span>
            <span class="url">{{ siteLabel }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Footer #}
    <div class="footer">
        <strong>Découvrez la collection complète en ligne</strong>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
